This package provides the "black lady" trick-avoidance card game,
also known as "Microsoft Hearts". It is based on Qt.

- offline and online games
- various card decks
- game variants (omnibus, no tricks bonus, new moon, perfect 100 etc.)

The aim is to avoid gaining points. Any Hearts counts 1 point, the
Queen of Spades 13. If one player gains 100 points or more, the game
is finished and and the player with the lowest score wins.
